        "The Toronto Maple Leafs signed top prospect Gavin McKenna and three veterans, with preseason games against Montreal and Ottawa set for September 19 and 23. The Toronto Blue Jays beat the Giants 10-0 last night, now facing the Padres Friday at 9:40 PM ET with a 44-49 record. The Toronto Raptors are preparing their Summer League squad to push new players out of their comfort zones while building toward free agency. The Washington Commanders begin training camp soon, with their first game at the Eagles on Sunday, September 13 in 66 days.",
